346,"y":1789,"width":96,"height":38},{"text":"호출에","x":1460,"y":1790,"width":101,"height":39},{"text":"의해","x":1578,"y":1790,"width":64,"height":39}]},{"text":"먼저 메인 메모리로 전송되어야 한다. 마찬가지로 CPU가 명령을 수행하기 위해서는 명","words":[{"text":"먼저","x":321,"y":1853,"width":60,"height":39},{"text":"메인","x":398,"y":1854,"width":65,"height":38},{"text":"메모리로","x":476,"y":1854,"width":130,"height":38},{"text":"전송되어야","x":619,"y":1853,"width":163,"height":40},{"text":"한다.","x":793,"y":1853,"width":73,"height":39},{"text":"마찬가지로","x":882,"y":1853,"width":169,"height":40},{"text":"CPU가","x":1064,"y":1853,"width":117,"height":39},{"text":"명령을","x":1194,"y":1853,"width":102,"height":38},{"text":"수행하기","x":1307,"y":1854,"width":134,"height":39},{"text":"위해서는","x":1461,"y":1854,"width":138,"height":39},{"text":"명","x":1613,"y":1856,"width":28,"height":38}]},{"text":"령이 메인 메모리 내에 있어야 한다.","words":[{"text":"령이","x":320,"y":1918,"width":61,"height":39},{"text":"메인","x":397,"y":1919,"width":65,"height":39},{"text":"메모리","x":475,"y":1919,"width":93,"height":39},{"text":"내에","x":585,"y":1920,"width":60,"height":38},{"text":"있어야","x":662,"y":1919,"width":96,"height":39},{"text":"한다.","x":769,"y":1918,"width":73,"height":40}]},{"text":"프로그램이 수행되기 위해서는 반드시 절대 주소로 매핑(mapping)되고 메모리에","words":[{"text":"프로그램이","x":380,"y":1984,"width":162,"height":40},{"text":"수행되기","x":560,"y":1984,"width":126,"height":40},{"text":"위해서는","x":706,"y":1984,"width":132,"height":40},{"text":"반드시","x":852,"y":1984,"width":96,"height":40},{"text":"절대","x":969,"y":1984,"width":62,"height":39},{"text":"주소로","x":1050,"y":1986,"width":102,"height":38},{"text":"매핑(mapping)되고","x":1168,"y":1984,"width":323,"height":46},{"text":"메모리에","x":1507,"y":1985,"width":135,"height":39}]},{"text":"적재되어야 한다. 프로그램을 수행하면서, 이러한 절대 주소를 생성하여 메모리의 프로","words":[{"text":"적재되어야","x":317,"y":2048,"width":170,"height":41},{"text":"한다.","x":499,"y":2050,"width":73,"height":39},{"text":"프로그램을","x":588,"y":2051,"width":163,"height":37},{"text":"수행하면서,","x":76